OL,3,AWhy the charts are full of old songs -
OL,4,Aand so are your playlists
OL,5,
OL,6,FLuminate, an independent entertainment
OL,7,Fdata and analytics company that tracks
OL,8,Fmusic, film, and television consumption
OL,9,Ffirst started tracking music streaming
OL,10,Fin 2008.
